{
  "note": [
    "The Projcon Office's fabric, cut from the one Lawanda layout in scripts/fabric-lawanda.mjs -- regenerate from there, do not hand-edit. PROJCON-OFFICE v2: 10 x 3.8 x 8, the eye at the middle. On the west wall the logo panel (LOGO-PSEUDO): a flame over a sleep chamber above the words Prajekt Kuntrool, which the painting letters. The whole south wall is the MURAL while COMPUTER-FIXED == false -- gaudy orange and purple abstract shapes, rippling -- drawn as one panel over the wall.",
    "South, the cryo-elevator mouth, 3.2 x 3.0 centred 1.5 up: CUT, and seen only once COMPUTER-FIXED == true, when the mural is gone and the door's exposed edge shows at the east jamb (CRYO-ELEVATOR-DOOR, x 1.6 to 1.9). Behind it the CRYO ELEVATOR's car (placed 2026-09-18, CRYO-ELEVATOR v2): its plain back wall 10.16 m from the eye and the south halves of its side walls, the door retracted -- fixing the computer gives it OPENBIT as it reveals it, so the office never shows it shut. The review page's COMPUTER-FIXED switch shows both states.",
    "North, 1.8 x 2.6 onto Project Corridor: its floor and its plain north wall 10.16 m out, about 2.3 m each side of the axis; the corridor's east and west mouths turn out of the view, and the PrajKon Awfis lettering is on the corridor's face of this wall, not readable from in here (PROJECT-CORRIDOR-MOUTH).",
    "East, 2.2 x 2.6 at z -1.0 onto the COMPUTER ROOM, looking along its whole 17 m: its north wall on the left from its x -6.3 to +5.6 (its red light hidden behind the bank from here), dark silent banks, and on the right its east wall about 22.2 m out. Through its north mouth, obliquely, a slice of Project Corridor East's floor and east wall and, through that room's east mouth, a sliver of the Main Lab's east wall about 37 m out; through its NE branch the Main Lab's bare east wall 35.4 to 35.6 m out (COMPUTER-ROOM-MOUTH). The Main Lab is an empty placeholder: paint no equipment and no second light."
  ],
